<!-- INSIGHT -->
<section style="padding-top:0">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="head">
      <div class="eyebrow">The insight</div>
      <h2>Fans don't want to chat. They want more story.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="chips">
      <span class="chip"><i>01</i>Fan interviews</span>
      <span class="chip"><i>02</i>Comment and bullet-chat analysis</span>
      <span class="chip"><i>03</i>Teardown of top AI companion apps</span>
    </div>
    <div style="margin-top:32px" class="svg-wrap">
      <div class="compare" style="min-width:560px">
        <div class="h"></div><div class="h them">Open-chat companions</div><div class="h us">IP + AI stories</div>
        <div class="rl">World</div><div class="them">User-made premise, no shared world</div><div class="us">The show's own world and characters</div>
        <div class="rl">Direction</div><div class="them">Drifts; users get lost and tired</div><div class="us">Chapters and goals give every chat a purpose</div>
        <div class="rl">Feel</div><div class="them">Improvised plots feel fake</div><div class="us">Writers keep characters true to the show</div>
        <div class="rl">Ending</div><div class="them">None</div><div class="us">Branches and many endings, one per fan</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="formula" aria-label="A good story equals character times plot">
      <span class="t">A good story</span><span class="op">=</span><span class="t hl">Character</span><span class="op">×</span><span class="t hl">Plot</span>
    </div>
    <p class="cap" style="margin-top:10px">Character: AI agents that feel real. Plot: open storylines that break past the script.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- DECISIONS -->
<section style="padding-top:0">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="head">
      <div class="eyebrow">Key decisions</div>
      <h2>How far to let the AI go</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="cards">
      <div class="card"><span class="k">Decision 1</span><h3>Bounded openness</h3><p>Writers own the world and the key beats. Users choose the path.</p>
        <div class="trade"><b>Gave</b><span class="give">Some freedom</span><b>Got</b><span class="get">Characters that stay true, plots that hold, content that stays safe</span></div></div>
      <div class="card"><span class="k">Decision 2</span><h3>IP first</h3><p>We launched with characters from the platform's top shows.</p>
        <div class="trade"><b>Gave</b><span class="give">Speed, under rights-holder constraints</span><b>Got</b><span class="get">A built-in audience and a cold-start solution</span></div></div>
      <div class="card"><span class="k">Decision 3</span><h3>Writers train the AI</h3><p>PMs and scriptwriters set characters, rules and quality bars together.</p>
        <div class="trade"><b>Built</b><span class="give">9 reusable prompt modules and an AI evaluation loop</span><b>Got</b><span class="get">Model pass rate 57% → 83%</span></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

